## Run the current baseline

The included code implements only the deterministic **recorded-lineage closure** baseline. Hidden-lineage inference and replay are research milestones, not silently mocked features.

```bash
python -m pip install -e .
skillrewind closure \
  --edges examples/recorded_edges.jsonl \
  --root skill://fast-http@sha256:bad001
```

Generate a recorded-evidence attestation:

```bash
skillrewind attest \
  --edges examples/recorded_edges.jsonl \
  --root skill://fast-http@sha256:bad001 \
  --output recorded-attestation.json
```

Run tests:

```bash
python -m unittest discover -s tests -v
```

## RewindBench

The benchmark will plant complete oracle lineage and then remove edges under controlled missingness. Planned scenario families include:

- direct inheritance;
- semantic laundering;
- implementation mutation;
- procedural inheritance;
- multi-hop contamination;
- memory-to-skill promotion;
- cross-model distillation; and
- compositional influence.

All security effects must be inert canaries or mocked side effects in isolated sandboxes.

## Research milestones

| Phase | Deliverable |
|---|---|
| 0 | Proposal, RFC, schemas, recorded-closure baseline |
| 1 | RewindBench-Core generator and provenance-loss operators |
| 2 | Multi-trace candidate recovery and calibrated strict negatives |
| 3 | Counterfactual re-derivation and active replay selection |
| 4 | Quarantine, clean-room rebuilding, validation, and attestation |
| 5 | Public-system adapters, experiments, ablations, and paper |

## Evidence discipline

The project distinguishes targets from findings. Any future number in the paper must map to a frozen experiment, metric, raw artifact, and analysis script. Hosted-model results must be archived separately from fully reproducible local runs.

## Closest related work

The proposal positions itself relative to MemoRepair, MemLineage, NeuroTaint, SkillTrace, SkillWiki, Agentic Unlearning, SkillJack, and PoisonedEvolution. Full references are in [`paper/references.bib`](paper/references.bib).

A key motivating result from MemoRepair is that its cascade-repair guarantee depends on complete influence provenance; its reported experiment shows substantial leakage after dropping only a small fraction of influence edges. SkillRewind focuses on recovering and testing those missing relationships before repair.

## Safety

Do not use live credentials, destructive commands, real exfiltration targets, or production accounts in benchmark payloads. Use canary strings, mocked flags, temporary files, and sandbox-only endpoints. Newly discovered vulnerabilities should follow coordinated disclosure.

